OL,3,GNEWSAHigh-value jewellery targeted in
OL,4,Aburglaries
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive homes were struck by burglars in
OL,7,Fthe space of two days by thieves
OL,8,Ftargeting high value jewellery.
OL,10,FFour properties in Maidenhead and
OL,11,FCookham were raided on the evening
OL,12,FFriday 6 November, while another house
OL,13,Fin Maidenhead was burgled the following
OL,14,Fday.
OL,16,FIn each of the incidents, thieves
OL,17,Fforced entry into the properties via a
OL,18,Ffront or back door while the victims
OL,19,Fwere not home.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
