OL,3,GNEWSAHigh-value jewellery targeted in
OL,4,Aburglaries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police, which is not
OL,7,Ftreating the crimes as linked, said
OL,8,Fburglaries often increase at this time
OL,9,Fof year as people leave their homes to
OL,10,Fmark celebrations like Diwali, Bandi
OL,11,FChhor Divas and Bonfire Night.
